TITLE Pure water pH 7, 150C, eq with chrysotile + talc; count Si species
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Chrysotile 0 10
    Talc       0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file si_species.sel
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Si_species_count
10 PUNCH SYS("count_si")
END
